Fixed: SparsityTools::reorder_Cuthill_McKee() and therefore
DoFRenumbering::Cuthill_McKee() had an accidental quadratic complexity in
the number of connected components of the graph. This led to a severe
slowdown for block-diagonal sparsity patterns, for example for
discontinuous elements without flux couplings. This has been fixed.
<br>
(Matthias Maier, 2026/10/02)
